## 25A. Lifecycle State Machines *(new in V6.5)*

Earlier sections describe how each entity's status changes over time in prose.
This section makes those transitions explicit contracts — an implementation
should reject a transition not listed here rather than inferring one is
probably fine.

{% mermaid_diagram src="/diagrams/mermaid/phase-1-6-research-thread-lifecycle.mmd" title="ResearchThread lifecycle" /%}
*Figure 10A. ResearchThread lifecycle, including the reopening path when production evidence (Section 21) revises understanding.*

